1
00:00:00,498 --> 00:00:03,398
WOLOWITZ:
Heads up! Watch out!

2
00:00:10,508 --> 00:00:12,678
(Leonard:)Are you mad at me?

3
00:00:12,677 --> 00:00:14,977
(Penny:)No, stop being stupid.

4
00:00:14,979 --> 00:00:18,319
(Leonard:)Um... whew?

5
00:00:19,317 --> 00:00:22,187
(Leonard:)Is this about the test,
or is this about us?

6
00:00:22,187 --> 00:00:24,017
(Penny:)Look, I don't need
a score on a test

7
00:00:24,022 --> 00:00:26,322
(Penny:)to make me worry about something
I'm already worried about.

8
00:00:26,324 --> 00:00:28,254
(Leonard:)What are you
worried about?
(scoffs)

9
00:00:28,259 --> 00:00:31,199
(Penny:)That we're engaged and
have nothing in common,

10
00:00:31,196 --> 00:00:32,826
(Penny:)and it scares me.

11
00:00:32,831 --> 00:00:35,831
(Leonard:)Yeah, that scares me, too.

12
00:00:35,834 --> 00:00:37,204
(Penny:)It does?

13
00:00:37,202 --> 00:00:38,872
(Leonard:)Sometimes.

14
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:41,270
Well, that's not good!

15
00:00:42,774 --> 00:00:45,204
(Penny:)You being blindly infatuated
with me was the rock

16
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:48,280
(Penny:)we were building
this relationship on!

17
00:00:48,279 --> 00:00:52,019
(Leonard:)Okay, well, this might
make you feel better.

18
00:00:52,016 --> 00:00:55,956
(Leonard:)Uh, we're both scared that
our marriage will be a disaster,

19
00:00:55,954 --> 00:01:03,024
(Leonard:)and so, that's something
that we have in common.

